'''Cheating Heart?''' (浮気調査, ''Uwaki Chōsa'', '''Cheating Investigation''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

==Effect==
Research Power UP (M): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 52 frames (1.73 sec).

